  "question": {
    "text": "The number of terms in the expansion of <math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>1824</mn></mrow></msup></math> which are integers is"
